{"title": "God of Ambition (Condition)", "pageid": 35401, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/God_of_Ambition_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/God_of_Ambition_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-God_of_Ambition_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/God_of_Ambition_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-God_of_Ambition_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/God_of_Ambition_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-God_of_Ambition_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"God of Ambition Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/God_of_Ambition_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-God_of_Ambition_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/God_of_Ambition_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>God of Ambition</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Mere mortals whisper petitions to the newly divine Gale Dekarios as The Once-Wizard, High Aspirant, The Lord of Zeal - but none have yet been granted an audience with the God of Ambition. Until tonight, that is. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/ApplyToDead\" title=\"Status properties/ApplyToDead\">ApplyToDead</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/DisableOverhead\" title=\"Status properties/DisableOverhead\">DisableOverhead</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/DisableCombatlog\" title=\"Status properties/DisableCombatlog\">DisableCombatlog</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/DisablePortraitIndicator\" title=\"Status properties/DisablePortraitIndicator\">DisablePortraitIndicator</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/IgnoreResting\" title=\"Status properties/IgnoreResting\">IgnoreResting</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\">Grants:</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Revelry\" title=\"Divine Revelry\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Divine_Revelry_Icon.webp/40px-Divine_Revelry_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Divine_Revelry_Icon.webp/60px-Divine_Revelry_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Divine_Revelry_Icon.webp/80px-Divine_Revelry_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Divine Revelry\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Divine_Revelry_Icon.webp/40px-Divine_Revelry_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Divine_Revelry_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Revelry\" title=\"Divine Revelry\">Divine Revelry</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Conjure forth a barrel of Shadowdark Ale from the Yawning Portal and spread an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_(Condition)\" title=\"Otto's Irresistible Dance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Irrestible Dance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_(Condition)\" title=\"Otto's Irresistible Dance (Condition)\">Irrestible Dance</a> across all nearby creatures. </dd>\n</dl><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Formsculpt:_Tressym\" title=\"Formsculpt: Tressym\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Formsculpt_Tressym_Icon.webp/40px-Formsculpt_Tressym_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Formsculpt_Tressym_Icon.webp/60px-Formsculpt_Tressym_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Formsculpt_Tressym_Icon.webp/80px-Formsculpt_Tressym_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Formsculpt Tressym\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Formsculpt_Tressym_Icon.webp/40px-Formsculpt_Tressym_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3a/Formsculpt_Tressym_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Formsculpt:_Tressym\" title=\"Formsculpt: Tressym\">Formsculpt Tressym</a> (<span aria-label=\"Bonus Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bonus Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Rearrange a creature's very being into the image of Gale's darling pet. </dd>\n</dl><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Word:_Ruin\" title=\"Power Word: Ruin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Power_Word_Ruin_Icon.webp/40px-Power_Word_Ruin_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Power_Word_Ruin_Icon.webp/60px-Power_Word_Ruin_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Power_Word_Ruin_Icon.webp/80px-Power_Word_Ruin_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Power Word: Ruin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Power_Word_Ruin_Icon.webp/40px-Power_Word_Ruin_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/Power_Word_Ruin_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Word:_Ruin\" title=\"Power Word: Ruin\">Power Word: Ruin</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Speak a word of disaster into the Galerian Weave, calling forth three beams of pure destruction that each deal <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">10d6+40</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/38px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/50px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a> damage. </dd>\n</dl></div>\n<h2><span id=\"Condition:_Aura_of_Possibility_.28Aura.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Aura_of_Possibility_(Aura)\">Condition: Aura of Possibility (Aura)</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Possibility_(Aura)_(Condition)\" title=\"Aura of Possibility (Aura) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Aura_of_Possibility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aura_of_Possibility_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Aura_of_Possibility_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Aura_of_Possibility_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Aura_of_Possibility_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Aura_of_Possibility_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aura of Possibility\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Aura_of_Possibility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aura_of_Possibility_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6b/Aura_of_Possibility_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Possibility_(Aura)_(Condition)\" title=\"Aura of Possibility (Aura) (Condition)\">Aura of Possibility</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Any allies near Gale Dekarios, the God of Ambition, receive a +10 bonus to all <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Checks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Checks\">Ability Checks</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<p>Gale has this condition in the Epilogue if he managed to become a god.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715010341\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.060 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.067 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2095/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33151/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7083/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.031/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1441713/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   57.200      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   57.200      1 -total\n 29.39%   16.810      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 15.90%    9.096      3 Template:Spell_action/format\n 14.56%    8.328      5 Template:Icon_text\n 13.71%    7.841     18 Template:Trim\n 11.77%    6.735      2 Template:Condition_sources\n  9.45%    5.406      1 Template:Condition\n  8.43%    4.824      8 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  8.26%    4.723      3 Template:IconLink\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35401-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715010341 and revision id 377489. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}